>**Raises nation's Prosperity, Resources and Supplies at the cost of Supplies.**
=2 Walkthrough
+ You must participate in a Campaign battle of 1-3 waves or up to three Campaign battles with one (or more) wave(s) each in one of your nation's territories. Seemingly participating in the battles is enough to finish this Op, you actually don't need to win all battles.
+ You do not have to do all 3 battles in the same area. However, you must do all 3 battles within the territories of the nation that the Campaign Op was started.
+ After the 3 battles are complete, or after 3 waves, have your performance assessed by the {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} at the fortification in the area. You will receive 210~260 exp.
+ Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to receive your reward of 723~832 Allied Notes. (Usually receive 800~ Allied Notes.)

=2 Notes
* You will receive EXP/Limit Points and Allied Notes from Campaign as well as the reward from the Campaign Op.
* Fighting through three waves of enemies (either triumphantly or at a loss) can result in a win, and this can be spread out over multiple campaign battles.
* A notice saying you have completed the mission will appear in the message window with Experience and {p:Allied Notes} upon satisfactory completion of the objectives.

=2 Objective
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
